  "ruleSetPolicy": "",
  "description": "This rule engine determines exchange offers based on the product type, brand, age, condition, and original price. The system evaluates if the product is eligible for exchange and calculates the exchange value accordingly.\n\nParameters Considered:\nProduct Type (String) – Mobile, Laptop, TV, Washing Machine, etc.\n\nBrand (String) – Apple, Samsung, HP, LG, Sony, etc.\n\nAge of Product (Number, Years) – 0-1, 2-3, 4-5, 6+\n\nCondition (String) – Excellent, Good, Average, Poor\n\nOriginal Price (Number, Currency) – Price of the product at purchase\n\nExchange Percentage (Number,Percent) – Based on condition and age\n\nFinal Exchange Value (Currency, Computed) – Derived from the exchange percentage applied to the original price",
